                        "entry_id": "c2eb9a59-0e09-3ca8-b60f-b485d3cb43ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The qualities characteristic of a hero, such as courage, bravery, fortitude, selflessness, etc.; the display of such qualities."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "845d00a9-de29-4620-854e-57729797f106",
                                "sense_id": "5fbda0da-1388-3303-9675-5fe8aea50865",
                                "text": "At the time, with the D-Day invasion of Europe going on, their heroism was hardly noticed. Plenty of other heroes were dying elsewhere. Plenty of bigger bits of history were being made."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
